CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# ---- Integration runs on a Mac (run-local.sh) ----
mcp/tests/Integration/.local-runs/

# ---- Disposable runs on a Mac (admin-page.sh), outside the app source tree ----
.mcp-it-runs/
